&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-right:0pt;line-height:11.5pt;"&gt;建物&lt;br/&gt;工具、器具及び備品&lt;br/&gt;構築物&lt;br/&gt;車両運搬具 &lt;/p&gt;
